      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Still an issue in 2019.08.16.18.20\nMinimum height does not even display all possible options. There is no scrolling on the build buttons so you only get local testing. The tags, which I would almost never look at, take up about half the panel. Please allow us to collapse these fields or add scrolling for the entire window as this is difficult to work with.",
